5. Powers of Inquiry Committee: 

 Inquiry Committee shall have the following powers:  
a) to summon and enforce attendance of any person and examine him on oath;  
b) ability to suspend the complainee or complainant as per the evidence for the duration of inquiry 
as per their set terms; 
c) to require the discovery and production of any document, picture, video or audio file;  
d) to adjudicate upon the matter and come up with a verdict; 
e) to penalize the guilty individual by reprimanding, imposing a fine, adding restrictions to his/her 
work setup/routine, extending probationary period, removing perks/benefits and/or termination 
of employment; 
f) to grant any remedy in favor of the aggrieved individual.

